1. Fast & Slow Pointer Pattern
Used when you need to find something in the middle or detect cycles.
Purpose:
Find middle
Detect cycle
Find cycle start
Palindrome

Problems
Middle of Linked List (LC 876)
Linked List Cycle (LC 141)
Linked List Cycle II (LC 142)
Happy Number (LC 202)
Palindrome Linked List (LC 234)

2. Two Pointers Pattern
Different from Fast-Slow.
Here both pointers move at the same speed.
Problems
Remove Nth Node From End (LC 19)
Intersection of Two Linked Lists (LC 160)
Partition List (LC 86)
